{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1344668-anyone-else-really-excited-about-legendlore","id":1344668,"title":"Anyone else REALLY excited about Legendlore?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Legendlore"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-30T08:33:46-07:00","id":1344668,"title":"Anyone else REALLY excited about Legendlore?","content":"I haven't listened to the podcast yet. Can anyone summarize it for me?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T12:51:19-07:00","id":1344724,"title":"","content":"I'm also excited for this game/D&amp;D setting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I will translate for my quick<b> L</b><b>egendlore</b> sum-up in Polish FB group I wrote...<br /> <br /> 'Interview about D&amp;D 5E based game where you play normal humans transported to fantasy world where they become heroes, with change of race ( or rather 'people', as here are described fantastical species ) or getting muscles or magic in your alter ego. Think here about <i>80s D&amp;D cartoon</i> or <i>Chronicles of Narnia</i> where ordinary mortals ends in realms like those. Setting is <i>based on the comic series</i>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/21088/Legendlore-01\" target=\"_blank\">available on DriveThru</a>. Game makes sure that all skin colors or sexualities are options for it - even are made all possible elven subraces reflecting Earth's humans skins - so you can remake, truly, anyone you like to play as. \u2764\ufe0f There are no constant bonuses from 'people' - only are <i>cultural</i> bonuses. North lands are cold, difficult, and people there are trading <i>a lot</i> - so characters from there take bonus to CON or CHA, regardless of their people. There is also adoption - you can play halfling ( equivalent ) raised by elf and dwarf marrige - and you choose who's bonuses you inherit. And if those do not fit - you can take bonuses from you Class. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/episode-75-legendlore-deep-dive/\" target=\"_blank\">https://onyxpathcast.podbean.com/e/e...ore-deep-dive/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 11-01-2019, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T13:24:20-07:00","id":1344737,"title":"","content":"I love it!!!<br /> <br /> Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />\u200b (no heart emojis on this forum lol)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T07:30:38-07:00","id":1345227,"title":"","content":"I'm very excited about Legendlore. I was already intrigued thanks to how well they managed Realms of Pugmire, but after the podcast I was like, &quot;I need to get this day one.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T08:32:04-07:00","id":1345239,"title":"","content":"Definitely<br /> <br /> I know Arthur Ashe was a tennis player. What does that quote mean?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T14:19:05-07:00","id":1345325,"title":"","content":"The idea of playing a modern day person of our world transported to a fantasy world sounds AWESOME!! <br /> <br /> I do wish it was in a classless system but 5e is awesome so its okay.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":661,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","user":"LordHeru","date":". 11-02-2019, 12:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T18:16:55-07:00","id":1345363,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar661_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"661\" data-vbnamecard=\"661\">LordHeru</a> definitely. Really excited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-01T23:33:10-07:00","id":1345399,"title":"","content":"As a person who's happy on how they handled did things with cultural bonuses I am pretty interested in how classes are like specifically warlock and monk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T07:30:37-07:00","id":1345435,"title":"","content":"The cultural bonus idea sounds great. And I love playing warlocks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T09:03:56-07:00","id":1345443,"title":"","content":"From what I've heard, only thing I'm sad on is no Half Elves. They've been my favorite for quite a while and the lack is disappointing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-02T21:46:24-07:00","id":1345519,"title":"","content":"<span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> The line is a link, but it's a quote from Ashe translated into First Tongue from Werewolf: The Forsaken.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T05:35:17-08:00","id":1345580,"title":"","content":"Amazing. Like Elvish in Tolkien.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-04T20:32:43-08:00","id":1346027,"title":"","content":"Soooo I realized that I was operating under the assumption that the people transported from our worlds now know that they have rpg like elements in their lives. (Like in the genre called LITRPG, of which i am a fan of.) While I hope this might be true, as I think about it, I realize I am probably off. <br /> <br /> But that said, anyone else think it would be cool if the characters themselves knew their mechanical stats. Like they could say in-game, in-character &quot;My HP is at 10.&quot; hehe","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-04T23:03:35-08:00","id":1346071,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m definitely interested as well. I\u2019m hoping there will be some notes in the GM section for dealing with PCs who try to use their modern knowledge and maybe some notes on why this world is still at a pseudo-medieval technology level (assuming they are anyway). <br /> <br /> ...That said, I do hope that the Devs and authors on this project read over a bunch of series in the \u201cportal fantasy\u201d genre just to make sure they aren\u2019t hitting any troublesome tropes. Especially since it became this huge thing in Japan with the Isekai genre (it\u2019s gotten to the point where it feels like half of the new anime and manga are Harem series, half are Isekai, and the only reason we have anything else is because there are plenty of Harem Isekai series out there).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-14T05:50:30-08:00","id":1348471,"title":"","content":"Yay for Legendlore excitement!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1344668-anyone-else-really-excited-about-legendlore?p=1346027#post1346027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Soooo I realized that I was operating under the assumption that the people transported from our worlds now know that they have rpg like elements in their lives. (Like in the genre called LITRPG, of which i am a fan of.) While I hope this might be true, as I think about it, I realize I am probably off.</div> </div> </div> </div>The comics have a character (I forget which one) explicitly say &quot;wow, this is like a D&amp;D world!&quot; so yeah, you can absolutely come in with rpg knowledge. Not quite the same as meta-knowledge that you have 10 HP and a +2 to hit though XD.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m hoping there will be some notes in the GM section for dealing with PCs who try to use their modern knowledge and maybe some notes on why this world is still at a pseudo-medieval technology level (assuming they are anyway).</div> </div> </div> </div>It's because the Realm operates on the Laws of Magic and Alchemy rather than the Laws of Physics. So their (for example) electricity =/= our electricity and therefore doesn't always work the same.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-14T16:42:16-08:00","id":1348573,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1713_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1713\" data-vbnamecard=\"1713\">mistress of whispers</a> thank you!! This sounds really awesome.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T11:23:34-07:00","id":1394093,"title":"","content":"We're back on KS! Please support and share as you can &lt;3<br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/339646881/legendlore-rpg-setting-for-5th-edition-fantasy-roleplaying-0\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects...-roleplaying-0</a></span><br /> </span><br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <br /> </span><br /> </span><br /> </span><br /> </span><br /> </span><br /> </span><br /> </span><br /> </span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T12:17:16-07:00","id":1394109,"title":"","content":"I will \ud83d\udc97. Gonna back it tonight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T12:41:31-07:00","id":1394118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mistress of whispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/legendlore/1344668-anyone-else-really-excited-about-legendlore?p=1348471#post1348471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yay for Legendlore excitement!<br /> <br /> The comics have a character (I forget which one) explicitly say &quot;wow, this is like a D&amp;D world!&quot; so yeah, you can absolutely come in with rpg knowledge. Not quite the same as meta-knowledge that you have 10 HP and a +2 to hit though XD.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure how I didn't see this, or maybe I did and thought to comment later and that never happened, hehe. But this is cool. While its not the exact same it is pretty nifty to look at a world around you and go 'this seems like D&amp;D&quot;. Hehe<br /> <br /> Little things like that really bring a smile to my face.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-04T13:46:31-07:00","id":1394140,"title":"","content":"Metagaming \ud83e\udd70","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-05T01:40:55-07:00","id":1394284,"title":"","content":"I backed the Kickstarter again. Can\u2019t wait to check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}